### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Create a student (use dummy data only)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aarav Sharma",
  "date_of_birth": "2005-04-18",
  "email": "aarav.demo@example.com",
  "phone": "+91 9876543210",
  "course": "B.Tech CSE",
  "address": "New Delhi, India",
  "enrollment_date": "2026-08-01"
}

### List students
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/students

### Filter students by name/course/date range
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/students?name=Aarav&course=CSE&born_after=2004-01-01&born_before=2006-12-31

### View student by ID (replace 1 with the ID returned by POST)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/students/1

### Update student fields
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "course": "AI & Data Science"
}

### Delete student (replace 1 with the ID returned by POST)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/students/1
